WEBVTT

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

01:49.000 --> 01:50.940
Oh, Mistress.

01:50.940 --> 01:52.470
He said his name was Hiro,
or something, right?

01:52.470 --> 01:54.310
Are you referring to my brother?

01:54.310 --> 01:55.740
What happened to him?

01:55.740 --> 01:57.750
I haven't seen him this morning

01:57.750 --> 01:59.550
If you mean Hiro, he went to school.

01:59.550 --> 02:01.190
School?

02:01.620 --> 02:05.050
Yes, he seemed excited about it, too.

02:05.050 --> 02:08.220
Today's his first day at a new school.

02:08.220 --> 02:10.900
I hope he makes a lot of friends.

02:19.900 --> 02:21.540
Huga.

02:22.700 --> 02:24.510
School, huh?

02:25.370 --> 02:27.880
He has no need to go there.

02:28.510 --> 02:31.650
He's going to be my servant
for the rest of his life.

02:35.820 --> 02:40.350
Everyone, quiet down and take your seats.

02:40.360 --> 02:43.660
Our new transfer student will introduce himself.

02:43.660 --> 02:46.490
Umm, I am Hiro Hiyorimi.

02:46.500 --> 02:51.910
My initials are read "ecchi-ecchi,"
but I don't have a perverted mind.

02:56.940 --> 02:59.980
Damn, that didn't go as planned.

03:00.910 --> 03:03.140
Okay, please take your seat.

03:03.150 --> 03:04.780
Yes, sir.

03:12.920 --> 03:14.730
This sucks.

03:26.770 --> 03:29.640
Did I screw up my first day at my new school?

03:29.640 --> 03:33.180
I spent all night thinking up that introduction.

03:36.680 --> 03:40.750
That's the mansion I'll be living in from now on.

03:40.750 --> 03:43.890
However, I'm just sort of tagging
along with my sister, the maid.

03:44.390 --> 03:46.200
But still...

03:51.830 --> 03:54.140
What was that all about?

03:54.660 --> 03:59.030
That princess hasn't told me a thing.

03:59.030 --> 04:01.480
It's as if everything was just a dream.

04:04.410 --> 04:06.250
Mistress!

04:12.750 --> 04:15.190
Where could she have gone?

04:16.950 --> 04:18.630
Mistress!

04:22.220 --> 04:24.160
Oh, Flan.

04:24.160 --> 04:25.830
Huga?

04:25.830 --> 04:27.260
Where's the Mistress?

04:27.260 --> 04:28.500
Huga.

04:28.500 --> 04:30.530
Oh? Oh well...

04:30.530 --> 04:33.070
Flan, please look after the house while I'm out.

04:33.500 --> 04:36.300
I'm going shopping.

04:36.300 --> 04:37.940
Huga.

04:45.380 --> 04:47.620
Wait!

04:54.090 --> 04:55.730
W..Wait!

05:07.470 --> 05:09.240
Ow...

05:11.070 --> 05:12.880
S..Sorry.

05:13.180 --> 05:14.810
Huh?

05:21.120 --> 05:22.820
My balloon!

05:25.020 --> 05:28.330
L..it's all right! I'll go get it for you.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.260
Kaoru...

05:35.430 --> 05:37.240
Got it.

05:39.400 --> 05:42.440
Huh? What's happening?

05:43.240 --> 05:46.810
My body is going limp all of a sudden...

05:49.880 --> 05:52.120
Are you all right, mister?

05:52.610 --> 05:55.120
Mom, he's...

05:56.420 --> 05:58.160
He's...

06:11.300 --> 06:14.440
Just as I expected, dying a pathetic death.

06:16.570 --> 06:18.570
What a troublesome guy.

06:34.820 --> 06:36.460
Asleep?

06:51.170 --> 06:54.680
Interesting, looks like it's my turn today.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.490
Over here!

07:03.290 --> 07:05.850
Oh, right, the balloon...

07:05.850 --> 07:07.490
Here!

07:08.320 --> 07:09.560
Yay!

07:09.560 --> 07:12.930
Is this him? He looks alive to me, ma'am.

07:12.930 --> 07:14.740
I'm sorry.

07:14.830 --> 07:17.710
He wasn't moving at all,
so I assumed he was dead.

07:25.910 --> 07:28.410
What happened back there?

07:29.110 --> 07:32.220
Did I just lose consciousness?

07:34.320 --> 07:36.130
I'm home.

08:05.510 --> 08:07.320
Over there?!

08:18.360 --> 08:20.030
Is that where you are?! Hold it!

08:20.030 --> 08:21.900
H..Hold it?

08:21.900 --> 08:24.600
What's the matter with her?

08:38.980 --> 08:40.010
There!

08:40.020 --> 08:40.850
Huga?

08:40.850 --> 08:42.490
Exactly!

08:44.420 --> 08:46.590
What a mess.

08:56.700 --> 08:57.770
Surround him!

08:57.770 --> 08:59.130
Huga!

08:59.130 --> 09:00.940
Is that you?!

09:12.510 --> 09:14.150
Huga.

09:26.660 --> 09:30.200
Huh? I..I'm not wounded at all.

09:30.400 --> 09:33.210
You're not used to it yet?
Not too bright, are we?

09:33.900 --> 09:37.100
Huh? B..But, Mistress...

09:37.110 --> 09:39.210
Don't call me that.

09:39.410 --> 09:41.510
Just call me Hime.

09:41.510 --> 09:44.490
Hiro, I'll tell you one more time...

09:44.910 --> 09:46.890
You possess half-immortality.

09:47.820 --> 09:50.760
It's because I graced you with the flame of life.

10:21.950 --> 10:23.760
Half-immortality...

10:27.190 --> 10:29.000
So, he's back.

10:29.060 --> 10:30.690
Let's rid us of the intruder again!

10:30.690 --> 10:31.660
Huga!

10:31.660 --> 10:33.470
Huh? Intruder?

10:34.000 --> 10:35.660
An invisible man.

10:35.660 --> 10:37.400
Invisible?

10:37.400 --> 10:39.240
He followed you here.

10:43.910 --> 10:45.270
Hiro, I'm back!

10:48.480 --> 10:50.510
It doesn't matter who they are,

10:50.510 --> 10:52.920
if they trespass in my mansion,
I can't let them leave alive.

10:53.550 --> 10:54.530
Sis!

11:01.590 --> 11:05.440
Hey, I'm the one you're looking for.

11:06.430 --> 11:08.240
Isn't that right?

11:13.900 --> 11:14.940
Leaving?

11:14.940 --> 11:16.100
Huga!

11:16.100 --> 11:17.300
Just as I thought,

11:17.310 --> 11:20.340
he won't come close to Flandre.

11:24.480 --> 11:27.180
Oh dear, this place is in shambles.

11:27.180 --> 11:29.180
Sis!

11:29.180 --> 11:30.180
Hiro!

11:30.190 --> 11:32.950
How's the new middle school?

11:32.950 --> 11:34.870
Let's talk about that later.

11:36.120 --> 11:40.160
Hey! I have to prepare the Mistress's dinner...

11:44.400 --> 11:48.070
I am a live-in maid here.

11:48.070 --> 11:50.340
I have to do my job!

11:50.340 --> 11:52.970
L..l can't explain why right now,

11:52.970 --> 11:55.710
but just know that it's dangerous.

11:55.710 --> 11:57.350
Hiro...

11:58.450 --> 12:00.250
Sorry, Sis.

12:00.250 --> 12:03.890
But it can't be helped. Stay away for now, please!

12:05.450 --> 12:08.200
Seems like he's really enjoying himself.

12:08.760 --> 12:10.320
Hime!

12:10.330 --> 12:11.960
Imbecile!

12:19.730 --> 12:21.540
My leg...

12:24.710 --> 12:27.080
What's that? Thread?

12:28.680 --> 12:32.750
Yes, this is the invisible man's favorite weapon,

12:33.350 --> 12:35.890
invisible thread, be careful.

12:36.920 --> 12:39.390
He's booby-trapped the entire mansion.

12:39.390 --> 12:41.200
The entire mansion?

12:43.730 --> 12:46.260
Now, Hiro,

12:46.630 --> 12:51.770
I know you didn't think I'd just be swinging this
chainsaw around without good cause.

13:24.300 --> 13:26.300
Nothing abnormal ahead.

13:27.440 --> 13:31.200
But do invisible men really exist?

13:31.210 --> 13:34.410
Plus, why would he be attacking us?

13:35.580 --> 13:39.920
And how do you fight someone you can't see?

13:40.380 --> 13:44.420
She's terrible, telling me to handle him by myself.

13:50.090 --> 13:52.730
It's here, something...

13:54.960 --> 13:59.380
Something is directly behind me.

14:10.140 --> 14:13.720
Ah, I'm fine. It's just my shadow.

14:22.360 --> 14:24.000
Huga!

14:30.430 --> 14:32.100
The invisible man...

14:32.100 --> 14:33.900
There!

14:33.900 --> 14:35.880
I'll cut him in half!

14:42.010 --> 14:43.740
Don't get in my way, Flandre.

14:43.750 --> 14:45.180
Huga.

14:45.180 --> 14:47.820
What? He's gone?

14:48.380 --> 14:50.020
Huga.

14:50.520 --> 14:53.220
It seems you may have inflicted a
good deal of damage on him

14:53.220 --> 14:56.330
and now his mobility has been severely limited.

14:57.260 --> 14:58.030
I see, in that case, we'll be able to fight him now.

15:01.900 --> 15:06.350
Also, Hime was ready to kill me.

15:07.340 --> 15:08.440
Over there!

15:08.440 --> 15:10.070
Huga!

15:23.050 --> 15:25.030
Did we let him get away?

15:39.870 --> 15:41.680
Found one.

15:44.540 --> 15:47.410
Where did Hime and Flandre go?

15:47.410 --> 15:49.710
I haven't seen them for a while now.

15:49.710 --> 15:51.850
I don't want to be alone!

15:55.650 --> 15:57.990
I didn't think you'd be dumb
enough to light a flame.

15:58.350 --> 16:01.630
All it serves to do is tell the enemy
where to find you.

16:02.620 --> 16:05.330
I've been waiting for it to get dark.

16:05.890 --> 16:09.260
Listen, I destroyed the circuit breaker earlier.

16:09.260 --> 16:11.800
So now, we're on equal footing.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.680
Neither party can see the other.

16:15.400 --> 16:17.410
This is where the true fight begins.

16:18.710 --> 16:22.520
Starts now? Are sure we'll be okay, though?

16:23.080 --> 16:28.080
Who knows. Unlike you, I'm not half-immortal.

16:30.150 --> 16:35.150
But did you forget what happened this afternoon?

16:35.260 --> 16:38.390
The flame of life only lasts you a few days.

16:38.390 --> 16:41.310
The flame will burn out soon enough.

16:42.760 --> 16:47.760
So, if I'm dead and not around when your
half-immortality time limit expires,

16:48.940 --> 16:51.310
there will be no one around to revive you.

16:55.840 --> 17:00.690
So, that was the flame of life burning out before.

17:15.630 --> 17:19.980
I see, so Hime was the one who saved me.

17:20.740 --> 17:23.400
This is the fate of a soldier.

17:23.400 --> 17:26.440
Just pray that I don't die, okay?

17:26.910 --> 17:29.080
But then, why?

17:29.080 --> 17:32.610
Why is an invisible man trying to kill you?

17:32.610 --> 17:36.430
My third oldest brother was shot
by the invisible man.

17:38.420 --> 17:41.060
The invisible man was my brother's subordinate.

17:41.720 --> 17:43.860
However, he killed my brother,

17:44.690 --> 17:49.270
even though he had sworn his allegiance to him.

17:50.630 --> 17:52.630
So, it's kill or be killed.

17:53.630 --> 17:56.710
And, if I'm the one killed,

17:57.740 --> 17:59.310
you'll die as well.

18:11.450 --> 18:13.260
Good work, Hiro.

18:14.820 --> 18:16.630
Damn it!

18:28.070 --> 18:31.180
Hurry, Hime, I can't hold on much longer.

18:33.410 --> 18:35.220
There you are!

18:35.840 --> 18:37.650
Caught you!

18:40.650 --> 18:42.290
Flandre!

18:44.050 --> 18:45.450
Huga?

18:45.450 --> 18:47.090
Wait!

18:47.960 --> 18:49.870
So, what will you do?

18:51.460 --> 18:53.230
There's nowhere to run.

18:54.900 --> 18:57.060
Escaped into the basement, huh?

18:57.060 --> 18:58.940
Good work, Flandre.

18:59.630 --> 19:03.880
Thanks to you, we're able to
trap him in the basement.

19:05.710 --> 19:09.210
I'm glad he didn't read through the plan.

19:17.250 --> 19:19.060
That smell...

19:19.790 --> 19:21.430
Gasoline?

19:22.620 --> 19:26.040
What a pity, my father left this mansion to me.

19:31.000 --> 19:33.670
Flandre, we're leaving the mansion.

19:33.670 --> 19:35.200
Don't leave Hiro behind.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.840
Huga!

20:03.000 --> 20:04.430
It's burning.

20:04.430 --> 20:09.340
I guess this is how games where you
live in a mansion usually end.

20:09.340 --> 20:10.940
It's not over yet.

20:10.940 --> 20:14.820
He won't be defeated so easily.

20:38.300 --> 20:42.270
So, you got revenge for your brother, huh?

20:43.570 --> 20:47.710
I may have gotten revenge or I may have not.

20:47.710 --> 20:49.520
In the big picture,

20:50.640 --> 20:55.790
the one who sent him after me is
one my siblings, anyway.

20:57.950 --> 20:59.800
Oh dear...

20:59.990 --> 21:03.660
Mistress, the mansion is on fire.

21:03.660 --> 21:05.960
Yes, it's burning more than I thought it would.

21:05.960 --> 21:07.490
Come again?

21:07.500 --> 21:09.430
It's beautiful.

21:09.430 --> 21:11.070
Sis!

21:26.610 --> 21:29.220
This work is back-breaking...

21:31.320 --> 21:33.120
Amazing, Flan!

21:33.120 --> 21:34.760
Huga!

21:37.120 --> 21:42.340
It seems Hime has all sons of
secrets that I don't know yet.

21:43.460 --> 21:46.970
But there are two facts that are clear.

21:47.870 --> 21:51.340
If you get involved with her,

21:51.340 --> 21:54.380
no amount of lives will help you.

21:55.380 --> 21:58.210
And the other is that

21:58.210 --> 22:03.460
I don't have a choice as to whether
or not I get involved with her.

23:42.980 --> 23:45.960
What? There's an assassin going after Hime?

23:46.850 --> 23:48.450
You're slow, Hiro.

23:48.460 --> 23:51.060
She's here to avenge her brother.

23:51.060 --> 23:52.630
Avenge her brother?

23:52.630 --> 23:54.830
She's Liza, Wildman's sister.

23:55.800 --> 23:57.610
Huga, huga.

23:57.770 --> 24:01.630
So, the siblings all want me dead?

24:01.640 --> 24:04.140
Next episode, Princess Rampage.

24:04.140 --> 24:06.670
Are they really going to kill Hime?

24:07.210 --> 24:08.540
Huga, huga.
